WHAT std-sqlite's MANIFEST BECOMES
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  [build]
  sources = ["vendor/sqlite3.c"]
  flags   = ["-O2",
             "-DSQLITE_ENABLE_COLUMN_METADATA=1", … the 32 of FLAGS.md ]

  [link]
  objects = ["build/sqlite3.o"]     # what [build] produced
  flags   = ["-lm", "-lpthread"]

  and `packages/std-sqlite/build/` joins what `make sweep` already
  removes (`rm -rf packages/*/build`).

